{"steam_appid":3743140,"steam_name":"Battleplan","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3743140/1661167927/fedf1aaac21169db9bcb3087020bbf3f03a563dc/1791793182/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1791801266","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257457682/a2416623f2acbee9de5af9783f07603402533ac0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1791801266","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/ceaa4c62ca59d7fd7dfedaf32817601403efa22f/ss_ceaa4c62ca59d7fd7dfedaf32817601403efa22f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791816634","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/0cd6a65e3dfa5d5c88e5a9be5b804e2abcd24753/ss_0cd6a65e3dfa5d5c88e5a9be5b804e2abcd24753.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791816634","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/2462a9a564e30f573ab73aa05184bfbb1ce1450b/ss_2462a9a564e30f573ab73aa05184bfbb1ce1450b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791816634","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/2dab2c2587915c34ff38ea97a33ad3dc90dcad0a/ss_2dab2c2587915c34ff38ea97a33ad3dc90dcad0a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791816634","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/455bdb3a6919da147727207853c7c72de3387166/ss_455bdb3a6919da147727207853c7c72de3387166.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791816634"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of entire divisions and fight in some of the war's largest battles. Battleplan is a unique real-time strategy game that simulates massive month-long battles with hundreds of thousands of troops second by second, day by day. You give high-level orders, then watch your officers and companies carry them out autonomously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras/03915ec38083d0194c6d874c3d22e1a9.poster.avif?t=1791816634\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras/03915ec38083d0194c6d874c3d22e1a9.webm?t=1791816634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras/03915ec38083d0194c6d874c3d22e1a9.mp4?t=1791816634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras/e48c5cbf59ade8e6338ed791964bbdc9.avif?t=1791816634\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras_big/e48c5cbf59ade8e6338ed791964bbdc9.webp?t=1791816634 width=1560 height=145 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create elaborate plans</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create elaborate, multi-step and multi-unit plans intuitively by directly drawing on the map. Employ varied tactics such as defence in depth, counterattacks, planned withdrawals and more. Perform preparatory bombardments before large set-piece attacks, then split the division to capture multiple objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras/37acd299b945aeb7d817b9aafcc22881.poster.avif?t=1791816634\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras/37acd299b945aeb7d817b9aafcc22881.webm?t=1791816634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras/37acd299b945aeb7d817b9aafcc22881.mp4?t=1791816634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras/5242cb570da23360e979927489a674aa.avif?t=1791816634\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras_big/5242cb570da23360e979927489a674aa.webp?t=1791816634 width=1560 height=145 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic army</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each division is realistically modeled with headquarters, regiments, battalions and companies. Watch your infantry, tanks, engineers, anti-tank guns, artillery and scouts work together and perform tasks autonomously. Customize the entire chain of command and order of battle of your entire army. Combine divisions into corps, or split units down to companies. Requisition and upgrade units throughout the campaign. Hire and fire officers for your divisions. Listen to their advice - or don't! Keep your officers alive so they gain veterancy (and quirks).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras/bf5907755913c66dcd64a68ef8903c3b.poster.avif?t=1791816634\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras/bf5907755913c66dcd64a68ef8903c3b.webm?t=1791816634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras/bf5907755913c66dcd64a68ef8903c3b.mp4?t=1791816634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras/30a24b3aa1d58fe0a856231f762c05ed.avif?t=1791816634\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras_big/30a24b3aa1d58fe0a856231f762c05ed.webp?t=1791816634 width=1560 height=285 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Massive battlefields</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across thousands of kilometers modeled using real-world geographic data. Each road, town, forest and swamp is exactly where they are in real-life. Place your artillery on the high-ground by examining real-world elevation maps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-time missions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission is simulated second-by-second, allowing you to pause, play in real-time or fast-forward at will. Mission lengths range from one week to a month.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras/0ecd0314350869756bace27328f73b40.poster.avif?t=1791816634\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras/0ecd0314350869756bace27328f73b40.webm?t=1791816634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras/0ecd0314350869756bace27328f73b40.mp4?t=1791816634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras/70b4a1d09cc204fd2de094ba53ee2f8c.avif?t=1791816634\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras_big/70b4a1d09cc204fd2de094ba53ee2f8c.webp?t=1791816634 width=1560 height=145 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master logistics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starve the enemy by cutting their supply lines. Fuel your advance by capturing supply depots. Pull back when your units run low on supplies. Supply is realistically simulated, with terrain dictating supply flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras/7e39da392dae6134128ba4057385567b.poster.avif?t=1791816634\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras/7e39da392dae6134128ba4057385567b.webm?t=1791816634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras/7e39da392dae6134128ba4057385567b.mp4?t=1791816634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras/448d5d261b0da1bb265b749cc4b32697.avif?t=1791816634\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743140/extras_big/448d5d261b0da1bb265b749cc4b32697.webp?t=1791816634 width=1560 height=285 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Win the war</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 10+ massive historical battles set on World War II specifically in  the Western Front, from 1944 onward. Upgrade your divisions with new attachments and promote officers. Let wounded divisions rest and recuperate. Gain powerful air support assets such recon, fighter-bomber and heavy bomber aircraft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relive history</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn real-world history by examining geo-tagged historical photos and videos where they were taken in real-life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><br></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 11 / 10 <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Celeron G4920 (Legacy: i3-2100) , AMD Athlon 200GE<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  Nvidia GeForce GT 1030 (Legacy: Nvidia GeForce GTS 450), AMD Radeon RX 460 (Legacy: ATI Radeon HD 5570)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible Sound Card</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 11 / 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 cores Intel | AMD CPU (Intel i3-8100, AMD Ryzen 3 1200)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia Geforce GTX 1040 3 GB (Legacy: Nvidia Geforce GTX 780), AMD Radeon RX 580 (Legacy: AMD Radeon R9 290X)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible Sound Card</li></ul>","genres":["Strategy"],"developers":["Foolish Mortals Games Inc."],"publishers":["Slitherine Ltd."],"release_date":"Oct 12, 2026"}